1>we will use a 9 by 9 matrix to  track everypossible position where stons can be placed.
2>we will assign black stone with O and white stones with X to ensure clear distinction
3>The 9 by 9 matrix ( A list with lists inside ) will initially have . in all locations to indicate placeholder characters
4> The user will be displayed an ASCII generated board whoose contents will be filled using the Matrixe's elements
Example: Top Corner 3X3 segment of full 9X9 board
[[.,.,.],[.,.,.],[O,X,.]]  <---- stored in memory
_____________
|_._|_._|_._|          <---- displayed to player
_____________
|_._|_._|_._|
_____________
|_O_|_X_|_._|

